    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82101" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκελ-ής</span></b> (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>round the leg</i> : hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκελῆ, τά</span>,
			<i>drawers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				28.38(42)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.157
			</span></i> : sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκελὲς λινοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					16.4
				</span></i>
			 ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκέλια</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with the legs apart</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαλμα
			π</span>., such as Daedalus first made, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				11b
			</span></i>.</div>
